// Title: Docker Container Discovery Via Dockerenv Listing
// ID: 11701de9-d5a5-44aa-8238-84252f131895
// Status: test
// Level: low
// Author: Seth Hanford
// Date: 2023-08-23
// Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1082
// Description: Detects listing or file reading of ".dockerenv" which can be a sing of potential container discovery
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((src.process.image.path endswithCIS "/cat" OR src.process.image.path endswithCIS "/dir" OR src.process.image.path endswithCIS "/find" OR src.process.image.path endswithCIS "/ls" OR src.process.image.path endswithCIS "/stat" OR src.process.image.path endswithCIS "/test" OR src.process.image.path endswithCIS "grep") AND src.process.cmdline endswithCIS ".dockerenv")
